1
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,880
Closed Captioning by Red Bee Media

2
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,480
Thank you.

3
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:03,660
Thank you.

4
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:33,077
We waited for Oikawa to show
up at Highton View Terrace.

5
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:35,077
He told us he was going
to the digital world,

6
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:37,977
but we figured the sealed gate
would fail and we could capture him.

7
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:38,980
We were wrong.

8
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:41,437
We followed Oikawa into a
strange dimension where we

9
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,457
found out Myotismon had been
controlling him for years.

10
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:48,597
Myotismon digivolved to Malo Myotismon
and destroyed our Okanimon and Mamemon.

11
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:52,237
After that, all we could think about was
what he could do to our Digimon friends.

12
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,957
Everyone but Davis, that is.

13
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,660
He and XVmon have gone
after Malo Myotismon.

14
00:01:56,780 --> 00:01:58,537
I don't think I've been
giving Davis enough credit.

15
00:01:58,620 --> 00:02:00,444
He's the bravest person I know.

16
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:18,131
He's too powerful, Davis.

17
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:21,217
Let's get out of here before he
turns X-V-Mon into a handbag.

18
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,860
No, I'll never retreat.

19
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:25,077
Not as long as there's a fighting chance.

20
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,537
I've never quit before and
I'm not gonna start now.

21
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:30,914
As long as X-V-Mon is willing
to fight, I'm backing him.

22
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,540
I'll never give up, Divus!

23
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:41,400
It's working.

24
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,420
It's working!

25
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:44,700
Be laser!

26
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,656
So you want to play hardball, do you?

27
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,900
All right!

28
00:02:51,180 --> 00:02:52,360
Go, X-V-Mon!

29
00:02:52,540 --> 00:02:54,537
Make him shut that ugly mouth of his!

30
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:55,660
Be laser!

31
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:58,161
Mental Illusion!

32
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,480
Hey, Mom, sorry I'm late.

33
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,530
Huh?

34
00:03:08,613 --> 00:03:09,477
Hello there, son.

35
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,677
Just in time for dinner.

36
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,900
Mom made your favorite goulash. Oh.

37
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:19,242
Wow, it's been a long time since
the whole family's been together.

38
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,377
Wow, I can't believe it!

39
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:27,177
There must be two dozen
different desserts here.

40
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:28,436
Are they all for me?

41
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:33,900
They're all for me! Yay!
Yay! Yay! All for me! Yay!

42
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:40,297
Dad, this is the digital
world I told you about.

43
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:43,517
It can be pretty strange at
first, but you get used to it.

44
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,430
Hmm.

45
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:47,237
I'd really like to introduce
you to some of the Digimon.

46
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,217
They may look small, but
they're pretty powerful.

47
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:51,937
You should have seen some of the
crazy stuff we've been through.

48
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:53,480
I think you'd be proud.

49
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:01,400
It's so nice.

50
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,080
Hey, isn't it beautiful?

51
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:05,960
Kari! Huh?

52
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:08,057
I was wondering if you
could tell me when I

53
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:10,728
can expect Nyaromon to
Digivolve to Salamon?

54
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,626
Do you take good care of her?

55
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,500
Yeah, of course I do.

56
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,037
Don't worry, as long as you're
giving her lots of love,

57
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,737
she'll Digivolve soon enough.

58
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:20,291
So, I heard a joke today.

59
00:04:20,460 --> 00:04:23,397
A duck walks into a pharmacy and
asks the clerk for some lip balm.

60
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:28,127
The pharmacist says, cash or charge, and
the duck says, just put it on my bill.

61
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,157
P .K.?

62
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:32,700
Hey, Patamon, what are you doing here?

63
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:36,020
I came to get you. We need you. What?

64
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:38,097
But I'm not finished eating dinner.

65
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,357
None of this is real.

66
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,440
It's an illusion.

67
00:04:40,580 --> 00:04:42,557
What are you talking about, Patamon?

68
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:47,560
Look, my family's finally all together.
Huh? Wait a minute. What's happening?

69
00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:49,250
Don't go!

70
00:04:49,333 --> 00:04:50,434
Patamon, do something.

71
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,860
I want them to stay.

72
00:04:52,060 --> 00:04:52,940
It's not real.

73
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,160
Wait a second.

74
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:56,811
They weren't here at all.

75
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:01,575
Melo, my Myotismon, you're going to pay.

76
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,500
There you are, dude. Davis?

77
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:07,040
So are you ready to help me? Mm-hmm.

78
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,420
This is so good.

79
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:13,477
I know I'm going to get a
stomachache, and I don't even care.

80
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,390
Yoli.

81
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:17,737
My dear, is this really
what you've always wanted?

82
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:18,650
Huh?

83
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,937
Well, of course.

84
00:05:20,020 --> 00:05:21,057
Dessert is my favorite meal.

85
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:24,217
Do you like not having your
brothers and sisters around?

86
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:25,888
Yeah, it means more for me.

87
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:32,477
Actually, I kind of miss them right now.

88
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,997
You're always surrounded by
your brothers and sisters,

89
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,637
and you feel like you get passed over,

90
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,037
so you've wondered what it would
be like if they weren't around.

91
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:39,950
Am I right?

92
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:41,610
You're right.

93
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:45,197
I guess I've always wondered what it
would be like to be an only child.

94
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:48,497
But I love my brothers and sisters,
and I love having them in my life.

95
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:49,410
Mm-hmm.

96
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:51,970
Thank you, Hawkmon.

97
00:05:52,053 --> 00:05:54,737
I guess I was peeing a
really big oinker back there.

98
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:57,817
Sometimes it takes someone to show
you things a little more clearly.

99
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:59,357
You're the greatest friend ever.

100
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,322
You're making my feathers blush.

101
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:04,614
Hey, guys, we can really use your help.

102
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:08,220
And that's how we defeated Daemon.

103
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,480
Pretty cool, huh?

104
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:11,910
Cody?

105
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:15,277
Armadimon, I've been
looking all over for you.

106
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,889
I want you to meet my dad.

107
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:18,090
Cody?

108
00:06:18,173 --> 00:06:19,003
I don't think that's your father.

109
00:06:19,086 --> 00:06:20,357
What are you talking about?

110
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,317
He's right here.

111
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,660
This isn't real.

112
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:25,937
Armadimon, I think I know my
own father when I see him.

113
00:06:26,020 --> 00:06:27,608
He's just being funny, Dad.

114
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,330
No!

115
00:06:35,413 --> 00:06:36,800
Wait, Dad! Don't go!

116
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,760
Cody, this is an illusion.

117
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:46,040
I can't believe he's gone.

118
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,197
He left again.

119
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:50,300
I never got to share the
digital world with my dad.

120
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:52,377
I won't make that mistake again.

121
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:54,397
I'm gonna share this world with my mom.

122
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,797
I hope she can handle it.

123
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,997
What do you say about that, Armadelomon?

124
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,845
I say it sounds like a winner.

125
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:00,790
Let's go.

126
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:07,650
Flamedermon!

127
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:09,200
Come on, let's go.

128
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:11,662
Everyone's waiting for us, Cody.

129
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,870
Yeah.

130
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:15,117
Isn't this just wonderful, Gatomon?

131
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:19,537
Humans and Digimon playing together without
some lunatic trying to destroy it all.

132
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:20,597
Yeah, but...

133
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,980
what is it?

134
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:25,857
I hate to break it to you, but this
isn't the way things really are.

135
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:26,770
Huh?

136
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:27,683
What do you mean?

137
00:07:27,766 --> 00:07:29,377
Have you been into the catnip again?

138
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:30,872
It's all a big illusion!

139
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:35,585
You mean none of this is real?

140
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:37,780
What nerve?

141
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:39,977
God, Omon, what's going on?

142
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:40,890
Where am I?

143
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,270
Huh?

144
00:07:49,540 --> 00:07:51,720
Come on, Kari, we need you.

145
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:56,337
Malomaerdisman cast a spell over all
of the Digi destined to distract you.

146
00:07:56,420 --> 00:07:58,067
Trust me, I know his tricks.

147
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,319
So then we wouldn't put up a fight.

148
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,860
He's always been lazy.

149
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:03,377
That's why he needed me.

150
00:08:03,460 --> 00:08:04,597
But those days are over.

151
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,033
I'm with you now, Kari.

152
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,310
Let's go.

153
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:09,813
I'm with you now, Kari.

154
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,740
I think I got sand in my brain! Huh?

155
00:08:18,140 --> 00:08:19,817
Wait, there's something up ahead.

156
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:21,606
I hope it's a water fountain.

157
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:23,260
What is that thing?

158
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,180
There's a person up there.

159
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:28,757
Wait, it's... it's...

160
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,740
It's a Digimon Emperor!

161
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:53,680
it's me there's no way
it doesn't make any sense

162
00:08:56,780 --> 00:09:01,717
wait what's going on we've come
to get some payback yeah for

163
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:03,697
all the pain and suffering it
caused digimon throughout the

164
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:06,437
digital world now it's our turn
maybe you'll understand how

165
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:10,520
helpless we felt when you were the
digimon emperor take this Get me!

166
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:18,220
Yes!

167
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,780
Yes!

168
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:27,010
Yes!

169
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:53,432
Wait a sec, Sam, I thought you were dead.

170
00:09:53,780 --> 00:09:55,977
I've come back to invite
you to stay with me here,

171
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:59,157
where you no longer have to suffer
for the errors of your past.

172
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,517
Your punishment is over.

173
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,457
I'm your brother.

174
00:10:01,540 --> 00:10:02,370
Trust me.

175
00:10:02,453 --> 00:10:04,117
I can't get these visions out of my head.

176
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,847
If I stay, will you help me?

177
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:07,596
Where have you been?

178
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:10,300
I've missed you, Sam.

179
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,060
Ken, can you hear me?

180
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,670
Huh?

181
00:10:13,753 --> 00:10:14,817
Wormon, what happened to Sam?

182
00:10:14,900 --> 00:10:16,257
He was never really here.

183
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:17,837
But he promised to help me.

184
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:19,437
You can't change your past, Ken.

185
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:21,402
You can only change your future.

186
00:10:21,540 --> 00:10:23,128
My brother was an illusion?

187
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:27,090
Malomyotismon.

188
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:28,450
That's it.

189
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:32,237
I'm tired of beating myself up
for what happened in the past.

190
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,117
I'm not the Digimon Emperor anymore.

191
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,297
I've paid for my mistakes.

192
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:37,717
I know that and so do all of my friends.

193
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,677
How dare he use my brother against me?

194
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,878
I'm not a tool for darkness anymore.

195
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:44,455
And Melo Maiorisman can't change that.

196
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:45,780
You said it.

197
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:47,920
We got your back, Ken.

198
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:50,900
Davis, TK, we're your friends, dude.

199
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:53,866
You can count on us no
matter how bad it gets.

200
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:56,237
Davis is right, Ken, we're a team.

201
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,150
Yoli!

202
00:10:57,440 --> 00:11:00,517
When one of us falls down, another
one of us picks them right up.

203
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,659
That's the way it's supposed to be.

204
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:05,340
It's a two-way street, Ken. Kari!

205
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:08,777
We're your friends and we need
you as much as you need us.

206
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:11,919
Without your experience, I
don't know where we'd be.

207
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:14,080
She's right, Ken. Cody!

208
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,217
But we can't tell you.

209
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:18,037
You have to believe it for yourself.

210
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,520
I do believe it.

211
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:22,355
We've waited a long time to hear that.

212
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,580
Hey, handsome!

213
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:29,997
It looks like your little
magic trick didn't work.

214
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:30,910
We're back!

215
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:32,860
Take him, guys!

216
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:36,880
Fire rocket, wonder flash, and fire!

217
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:42,117
Check it out, Davis.

218
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,097
They really hurt him.

219
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:46,117
But how did Xvmon split into
his three digivolutions?

220
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,157
It doesn't make sense.

221
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,897
Not even for this crazy place.

222
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:50,137
It was really weird.

223
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:53,097
I was wishing that Xvmon could get
stronger, and it just happened.

224
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:54,010
Huh?

225
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,017
Malomyotismon was making my blood boil,

226
00:11:56,100 --> 00:11:58,237
so I wished Xvmon was
strong enough to stop him.

227
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,537
Then there was three of them.

228
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:00,855
How is that possible?

229
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:04,497
Somehow in this weird dimension,
emotions become a reality.

230
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:06,157
Davis must have tapped into something.

231
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,497
Are you ready, Patamon?

232
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,410
You bet!

233
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:13,307
I don't want the powers of
darkness to hurt any of my friends.

234
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:17,860
Patamon Armored Digiball 2!

235
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:20,460
Angemon Digiball 2!

236
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:23,280
Patamon Digiball 2!

237
00:12:29,500 --> 00:12:31,800
Pegasus-mon Galloping Hope!

238
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:34,740
Magna Angemon! Angemon!

239
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:36,330
What's this?

240
00:12:36,413 --> 00:12:38,900
End of fate! Earth! Star shower!

241
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:44,520
Pokémon, are you ready for
some action? Indubitably!

242
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:47,160
We are strong! We are strong!

243
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,550
We are strong!

244
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:52,940
Pokémon Armored Digivolution!

245
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:55,420
Pokémon Digivolution!

246
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:57,880
Pokémon Armored Digivolution!

247
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,540
Sori-mon, Samurai of Sincerity.

248
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:08,880
Aquila-mon.

249
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:11,060
Holsmon, the Wings of Love.

250
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:15,900
Grand Horn. Tempest Wing. Double Stars.

251
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:23,000
Ready to join the party?

252
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,277
That's a great idea.

253
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:29,100
I want Mallow Myotismon to be stopped
before he can hurt any more Digimon.

254
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,030
Armadimon!

255
00:13:32,140 --> 00:13:33,460
Armored Digibomb 2!

256
00:13:34,260 --> 00:13:35,090
Armadimon!

257
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,340
Digibomb 2!

258
00:13:37,060 --> 00:13:37,890
Armadimon!

259
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:39,520
Armored Digibomb 2!

260
00:13:44,980 --> 00:13:45,810
Submarimon!

261
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:47,577
Reliable Guardian of the Seas!

262
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:49,180
Antillomon! Digmon!

263
